WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:05.850
<i>The strongest Duelists from all over the world clash during the World Duel Carnival.</i>

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.900
<i>One must collect five Heart Pieces in order to enter the Finals.</i>

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>I already got four Heart Pieces! I'm definitely making it to the Finals!</i>

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:22.710
<i>My dear brave Duelists, you've endured the Duel Carnival until the very end!</i>

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.920
<i>Tomorrow is your last day to compete for Heart Pieces!</i>

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.880
<i>Warriors, rest up for now 
and prepare to assault once again tomorrow!</i>

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.880
<i>Heart Burning!</i>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:40.760
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, you use Photon Mode to Number Hunt far too much!

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.730
If you keep it up, Kaito-<i>sama</i>, your body will...

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.770
I don't need you to worry about me.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.110
Just keep your mouth shut and continue gathering information on the Numbers.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.940
U-Understood!

00:00:58.570 --> 00:00:59.320
Haruto.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.120
How are you feeling?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:06.000
Brother...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.080
I'm steadily collecting the Numbers.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:10.960
Very soon...

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.970
I will cure your sickness very soon.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:17.300
Just endure it a bit longer...

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.800
Brother...

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.440
Brother...

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:31.900
I'm okay. It's nothing.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.120
Brother...

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.370
I must go...

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.180
Wh-What is that?!

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.730
C'mon, I went so far to root for you.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.240
This is the least you can do to thank me for not abandoning you.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.860
Even so...

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.570
God... You're gonna get fat...

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.120
Did you say something?

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.620
No... Nothing.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:30.670
Wh-What the?

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:32.080
That kid's in danger!

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.220
H-He's...

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.890
Kaito's little brother?

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:45.810
Yuma!

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.770
What the heck are you-

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:06.100
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:09.150
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:16.410
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:25.670
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:30.170
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:36.630
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:41.430
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:47.100
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:52.360
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.240
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.530
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:03.700
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.290
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.460
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:15.010
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.510
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:20.510
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:27.310
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:43.510
"Number 40:
 The Visitor from Heartland, Haruto"

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.210
Yuma...

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:43.840
Yuma!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.350
Huh?

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.350
Look, Yuma.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:51.810
Eh?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.060
Wha-

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.610
What the heck is this?!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.280
What in the world happened?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:09.200
He most likely activated some kind of power during the moment of the crash,

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.990
which sent everything within that dimension flying back.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:16.120
Just what is this young boy...?

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.340
Aren't you cold?

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.840
Huh? Wha-

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.300
C-Could you be able to...?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.050
Are you able to see me?

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:32.010
Why? Who are you?

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.600
Hey, you serious?!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.690
You can even talk to him?!

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.650
My name is Astral.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.770
Astral...

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.160
Astral...

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.620
Do you know me?

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.790
Yuma!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.790
Are you okay?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.340
About that...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.380
Th-This is pretty bad.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.920
Let's go, Yuma!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.340
Eh?!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.140
I want to hear this child out!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.720
Even if you say that...!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.230
Fine! Guess there's no helping it!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.480
Y-Yuma!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:20.810
H-Hey! That was my car!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.110
Man oh man, he went and put a giant hole in there!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.820
Guess he was in a surprisingly bold mood.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.990
How can you be so carefree about this?

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:33.120
If Mr. Heartland hears about this...

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.700
Heh, good point.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:38.000
Then I guess we shouldn't let Kaito hear about it either.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.540
His mood'll be scary if he hears Haruto went missing.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.210
Let's go.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:45.500
Hmm?

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.180
<i>This evening in C Block of the eastern area of the city,</i>

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.930
<i>at intersection 3562, an incident occurred that toppled a mobile trailer.</i>

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.810
Whoa, this became huge news just like that!

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:08.860
Why the heck did I have to bring him home with me?!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.360
 Yuma's making a fuss.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.910
<i>Yuma's throwing a fit.</i>

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:15.660
Where did you come from? Why do you know me?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.370
Hey, why aren't you cold?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.370
Yuma!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:21.710
Huh?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.290
Dinner's ready!

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.170
You should help out a little!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.130
Whoa! Duel <i>Karaage</i>!
 ["Duel Fried Chicken strips"]

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.260
Duel <i>Yakiniku</i>
 ["Duel Grilled Fish (Or Meat)"]

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:30.970
Duel-<i>jiru</i>!
 ["Soup with Dueling in it"]

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.050
Even Duel <i>Nikujaga</i>!
 ["Duel Meat-Potato"]

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.760
Looks delicious!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:35.470
Hey!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.770
Say <i>itadakimasu</i> first!
 [Expression of gratitude]

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.650
That's right. It's bad manners when we're in front of a guest.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.270
I got it.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.730
Eat as much as you want!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.490
So let's dig in!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.450
<i>Itadakimasu</i>!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.790
Granny, this <i>nikujaga</i> is delicious!

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:04.380
Is it! Eat your fill!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.750
You aren't gonna eat anything?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.500
You aren't hungry?

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:12.010
Don't feel the need to hold back.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.180
Maybe <i>you</i> should hold back some.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.470
What's your problem?

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.800
What?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.510
- Why're you singling me out?
 - Haruto.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:21.520
- I haven't gotten to eat much.
 - Liar! You ate a ton of meat already!

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.020
I did not eat it!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.830
How is it? Good, right?

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.380
This is how you eat with everyone.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.630
Haruto...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.840
Ask for seconds.

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.090
Seconds.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:00.260
Listen up. If you find the boy, notify me right away.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.980
Don't try to lay your hands on him, or you'll end up like that hole.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:11.400
But I wonder where that kid came from.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.030
I'm not sure.

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:17.110
I have no way of contacting Kaito, and I don't know where the guy's at.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:22.950
Kaito? If you meet him, you may end up Dueling against him again.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:25.080
And if you lose...

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.750
Well, what happens happens.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.170
Yuma.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:29.590
Huh?

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:34.050
I have a lot of things I want to ask him... Haruto.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:37.760
I'm certain that he knows something about me.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.020
Brother...

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:49.940
Brother!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.450
Well, tomorrow I'll take him-

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.080
Haruto!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.380
Haruto!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.500
Haruto!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.050
Wait for me, Brother.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.640
Haruto!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.690
Shit! Where the heck did Haruto run off to?

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.610
There could be another incident like before...

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.610
That's it!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.150
Huh?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:43.830
This way!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.410
Wait! Hey!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:47.540
What happened?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.920
What was that? Was like an explosion...

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.750
Hey, what's the deal here?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.630
What happened?

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.380
This must be Haruto's doing.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.510
Yeah, there's no mistaking it.

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:02.510
Then he might still be around here.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:06.020
Haruto!

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.640
Found him!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.230
Haruto!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.070
Hey, wait up!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.690
Where do you think you're going?

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.360
I must go...

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.740
Go... where?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.620
To that place.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.660
Brother is...

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.960
You're looking for Kaito, aren't you?

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:37.630
I understand. I promise I'll bring you back to Kaito's place tomorrow.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.300
So for today...

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:42.260
Yuma!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:44.970
Kotori, get away from him!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:45.600
Huh?

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.320
H-Haruto...

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.700
Oh, there you are!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:07.160
We got a response at Block B-12.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.700
Are you positive?

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:12.120
Yeah. The change in atmosphere after a dimensional overspill ain't a joke.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:16.340
That boy just used his power. He's in high spirits!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:27.970
Brother...

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:33.390
He's really trying to go meet Kaito.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.940
Yeah, more than likely.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.320
Wh-What the?

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.610
Found you!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.000
Okay boy, your evening stroll ends here.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.370
Hmm? You're...!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.830
What do you want with us?!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:59.800
That's for me to feel. Why are you with Haruto?

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:03.840
Well... He kinda... spent the night with me.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.760
I took him in!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.260
I don't get a damn thing you're saying.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.310
Okay, boy. We're going back.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.980
Going back where?

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.440
What are you gonna do with Haruto?

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:18.900
It has nothing to do with you two.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.110
Now let's go.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.910
Haruto...

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.160
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.630
Haruto doesn't look like he wants to!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:43.340
You're such a persistent brat! He's just going back to Heartland!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:51.260
<i>Now, let's go back to Heartland.</i>

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.220
Wh-What the?

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.310
Do not get in my way.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:02.570
What? There's a large rise in the dimensional distribution!

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.070
Run, Gauche!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.160
The controls...!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.370
Droite!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.960
Gauche! Are you safe?!

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.000
Yeah...!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.420
What?!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:33.430
I understand, Haruto.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:38.850
If you want to go to Kaito, I'm definitely gonna take you there!

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.900
The boy's with those middle school brats!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.320
Listen! Find them at all costs!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:48.780
Yuma Tsukumo...! That bastard!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:08.090
Brother...

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:09.800
Brother...

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:14.260
Is Kaito on the other side of that door?

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:15.260
Yuma...

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.600
If Kaito's there...

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.200
What's going on?

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.580
Kaito isn't here.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.500
Where...? Where are you?

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.160
Gone... Gone!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:41.120
He's gone!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.460
Hey, Haruto!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.920
He's not here!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.750
What do you mean he's not here?

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.260
I thought you were looking for Kaito... for your brother?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.680
It's really small...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.140
It's small and sweet...

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.680
Small...?

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.140
When my brother isn't around...

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:25.790
Haruto!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:30.380
Isn't this light different from the other times?

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:31.880
This is...

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.510
Could this light be...?

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.260
Hey!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:29.190
<i>We should be fine after coming this far. Don't worry.</i>

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:33.990
<i>Haruto, I will protect you at all costs.</i>

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.070
<i>Haruto...</i>

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:41.540
<i>Here.</i>

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.170
<i>It's called caramel.</i>

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.750
<i>It's got a magical power that makes you feel better.</i>

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.880
<i>Eat it, Haruto.</i>

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:02.760
<i>Delicious...! It's really delicious!</i>

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:04.350
<i>I feel better!</i>

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.770
<i>I see...</i>

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.230
<i>Huh? But what about you, Brother...?</i>

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:12.190
<i>I'm fine so long as you're doing fine.</i>

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.030
<i>Brother...</i>

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.200
<i>Haruto... I'll stay with you forever.</i>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.420
<i>Let go! Let go of me!</i>

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.210
<i>Haruto!</i>

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:38.380
<i>Now, let's go back to Heartland, Haruto.</i>

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.010
<i>Haruto!</i>

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:47.100
<i>Haruto!!</i>

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.440
Brother...

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.060
This time, I will...

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:55.730
BROTHER!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.990
Haruto!!

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:02.820
Yuma!

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:06.540
Haruto's searching for something called caramel!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.000
Caramel?

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.250
What do we need caramel for?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.250
Haruto likely came here so Kaito could give him caramel!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.670
So Kaito could?

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:23.010
This is bad, Yuma! At this rate, Haruto's power will swallow up everything!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:23.930
What?!

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.890
Sh-Shit...

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.640
What should we do?

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.520
Haruto, why do you want caramel?

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.150
Kotori!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.320
Do you have any caramel on you?

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:41.110
Caramel?

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.120
Haruto... Haruto!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.750
Look at this! This is what you're after, isn't it?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.380
This caramel!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:03.930
You wanted Kaito to give this to you, right?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.300
I'll... let you...

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:08.640
...meet with Kaito!

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.600
So...

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.770
I'm gonna bring it to ya!

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:19.820
Haruto, you aren't alone.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.490
You aren't alone!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:30.950
Brother is... always tired because of me.

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.540
So...

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.710
This time, I wanted to give my brother caramel.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.420
I wanted him to eat the caramel.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.670
I saw Haruto's memories.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:48.180
Those two were running away from something and were cornered here.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:54.230
When he saw Haruto was nervous and sad, Kaito gave it to him to give him courage.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:58.020
More than likely, he wanted to do the same for his brother Kaito.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.650
Haruto... You...

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:08.620
Those guys just won't quit!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.240
I won't let you take Haruto!

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.500
If you want some of this, come and-

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.550
Wh-Who are you?

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.420
I will grant Haruto-<i>sama</i>'s wish.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.600
H-Hey, Haruto!

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.730
You...

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.230
It seems Haruto-<i>sama</i> wanted to see me again.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:43.690
Let's go.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:46.660
Hey, hold up a minute!

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:52.080
My mission is to destroy the Astral World.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:55.250
In order to produce more screams.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.380
Haruto...! Haruto!

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:04.050
Haruto... Just who are you...?

00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:23.020
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.950
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:34.870
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:37.910
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:41.500
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:45.590
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.380
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:55.890
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.190
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:13.780
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.740
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:17.540
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.920
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:29.550
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.970
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:35.810
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:38.100
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:42.730
What the heck do you mean?

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:46.980
The guy we handed Haruto over hasn't returned yet?!

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:49.320
I'm not lying!

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:52.360
There's a white stone inside the rainbow?

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:54.700
I can hear his voice...

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:57.740
Kaito, I promised Haruto.

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:00.160
That I would definitely reunite you two!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.540
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:05.420
"Haruto's Gone! A New Enemy, Tron"

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.500
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:13.800
Kaito sure is worried about Haruto!

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:16.140
But now that I think about it, that's just how you treat a little brother.

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.310
Is that how sibling relationships work?

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:20.730
Man, I sure want a sibling!

00:24:20.730 --> 00:24:22.060
You have one right here!

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.730
Oh yeah!
